# DEPRECATED as a path map. Ports and worktrees are computed by
# tools/scripts/seats.conf + seat-lib.sh (Mac Studio prod-safe layout).
#
# Do not allocate 3000 / 5173 / db fardel to agents.
#   prod stdb  :3000   db fardel   ~/.local/share/spacetime/data
#   lead vite  :5173   (human only; Pages is Cloudflare)
#   dev-N      stdb 3200+N  vite 5200+N  db fardel-dev-N
#   qa-N       stdb 3240+N  vite 5240+N  db fardel-qa-N
#
# Use: source tools/scripts/wt-env.sh <slug>
#      ./tools/scripts/seat-list.sh
